        "text": "All four tasks completed. Here is a summary of what was produced.\n\n**Output: `/tmp/aws-object-storage/extension-code/src/utility/` (directory)**\n\nThree implementation files plus a package init were written:\n\n---\n\n`utility/__init__.py`\nRe-exports the three classes so callers can write `from utility import S3ClientFactory, S3Operations, OutputFormatter`.\n\n---\n\n`utility/s3_client.py` \u2014 `S3ClientFactory`\n- `__init__(access_key_id, secret_access_key, region_name)` \u2014 stores credentials; holds a reference to the created client.\n- `create_client() -> Any` \u2014 calls `boto3.client(\"s3\", ...)` with the stored credentials; returns the client.\n- `close() -> None` \u2014 calls `client.close()` and clears the internal reference; safe to call unconditionally from a `finally` block.\n\n---\n\n`utility/s3_operations.py` \u2014 `S3Operations`\n- `__init__(client)` \u2014 accepts the boto3 client produced by `S3ClientFactory`.\n- `_classify_client_error(error) -> NoReturn` \u2014 reads the `Code` field from the `ClientError` response and raises `AuthenticationError`, `BucketNotFoundError`, or `S3OperationError` as appropriate.\n- `list_objects(bucket_name) -> tuple[list[dict], int]` \u2014 paginates `list_objects_v2`; accumulates all objects with ISO 8601 UTC `last_modified`; returns `(objects, total_count)`. Output cap is left to the caller.\n- `upload_file(local_file, bucket_name, s3_object_key) -> None` \u2014 calls `client.upload_file`; maps `FileNotFoundError` to `LocalFileNotFoundError` and all `ClientError` codes via `_classify_client_error`.\n\n---\n\n`utility/output_formatter.py` \u2014 `OutputFormatter`\n- `format_objects_table(objects) -> str` \u2014 renders objects as a `tabulate` `rounded_outline` table; returns the empty-bucket message when the list is empty.\n- `format_truncation_notice(displayed_count, total_count) -> str` \u2014 returns the cap notice string.\n- `build_list_objects_result(bucket, total_count, displayed_count, objects) -> dict` \u2014 constructs the List Objects Extension Output `result` dict.\n- `build_upload_result(bucket, key, s3_uri, size_bytes) -> dict` \u2014 constructs the Upload File Extension Output `result` dict.\n- `format_upload_confirmation(local_file, s3_uri, file_size_bytes) -> str` \u2014 builds the multi-line STDOUT upload confirmation message.\n\n**Validation results:**\n- `boto3.client`, `botocore.exceptions.ClientError`, and `tabulate.tabulate` all confirmed present in the venv at the pinned versions.\n- All five exception classes imported by `s3_operations.py` confirmed in `exceptions.py`.\n- `py_compile` passes cleanly on all `.py` files under `src/`."
      }
